.TH KEYHOLDER 1
.SH NAME
keyholder \- administer Keyholder customers over authenticated private access
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B keyholder
[--host SSH_ALIAS] [--backend ID] [--json] RESOURCE ACTION [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Manage customers, accounts, subscriptions, inbound choices and billing.
Run keyholder help RESOURCE ACTION for complete arguments.
.SH SECURITY
Explicit secret exports require a terminal or a new mode-0600 file selected with
--save-link. Destructive operations require --confirm. After an uncertain mutation,
inspect current state before retrying. Protect SSH access and Telegram admin chats.
.SH CONFIGURATION
KEYHOLDER_ADMIN_CONFIG selects a JSON file with host, ssh_config and remote_path.
Panel credentials stay in the core application.
.SH COMPONENTS
This package provides the client, not the API server or privileged dispatcher.
Keyholder owns account and billing rules. The operator supplies a compatible
server dispatcher.
.SH SEE ALSO
keyholder help, README.md, docs/development.md
